text.section:
A unitrust policy must provide the period used under §§ 64.2-1044 and 64.2-1045. Except as otherwise provided in subdivision B 3 of § 64.2-1047, the period may be:

A calendar year;


A 12-month period other than a calendar year;


A calendar quarter;


A three-month period other than a calendar quarter; or


Another period.
